## Spacing System

### Margin & Padding Scale

Use consistent spacing values based on a flexible scale:

```scss
// Extra Small
5px, 6px, 7px, 8px, 10px

// Small
12px, 15px, 16px, 17px, 18px, 20px

// Medium
22px, 23px, 24px, 25px, 26px, 27px, 30px

// Large
34px, 35px, 40px, 45px, 48px, 50px

// Extra Large
57px, 60px, 64px, 75px, 76px, 83px, 92px, 94px, 96px, 100px

// Section Spacing
108px, 124px, 132px, 135px, 153px, 180px, 200px
```

### Common Spacing Patterns

#### Component Internal Spacing
```scss
// Card padding
padding: 20px 22px 17px;
padding: 20px 16px 10px 16px;

// Section padding
padding: 30px 24px;

// Item margins
margin-bottom: 35px;
margin-right: 27px;
```

#### Section Spacing
```scss
// Section vertical padding
padding: 108px 0px 76px;    // Standard section
padding: 132px 0px 94px;    // Large section
padding: 100px 0px 92px;    // Alternative section
padding: 153px 0px 135px;   // Extra large section
```

#### Gap Utilities
```scss
gap: 7px;    // Small gap
gap: 20px;   // Medium gap
gap: 25px;   // Large gap
gap: 30px;   // Extra large gap
gap: 64px;   // Section gap
```

