## Border Radius

### Standard Radius Values

```scss
// Small elements (badges, small buttons, inputs)
border-radius: 4px;
border-radius: 5px;
border-radius: 6px;

// Medium elements (buttons, inputs, small cards)
border-radius: 8px;
border-radius: 10px;

// Cards and containers
border-radius: 12px;

// Circular elements
border-radius: 50%;
```

### Compound Radius Patterns

```scss
// Card tops
border-radius: 12px 12px 0px 0px;

// Card bottoms
border-radius: 0px 0px 12px 12px;

// Mixed radius (badges)
border-radius: 5px 0px;
```

### Usage Guidelines

- **4-6px:** Small UI elements (badges, chips, small buttons)
- **8px:** Form inputs, medium buttons
- **10px:** Medium containers
- **12px:** Standard cards, containers, large buttons
- **50%:** Profile images, circular badges, round buttons

---

## Animations & Transitions

### Standard Transitions

```scss
// Default transition
transition: 0.3s;

// Specific properties
transition: transform 0.3s;
transition: opacity 0.3s;
transition: transform 0.3s, opacity 0.3s;
transition: opacity 0.4s;

// Long transitions
transition: 1s;
```

### Common Animation Patterns

#### Hover Effects
```scss
// Scale on hover
&:hover {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: scale(1.05);
  transition: 0.3s;
}

// Simple transform
&:hover {
  transform: scale(1.05);
}
```

#### Fade Effects
```scss
// Fade in/out
opacity: 0;
&:hover {
  opacity: 1;
}
```

#### Transform Effects
```scss
// Rotation
transform: rotate(180deg);

// Perspective
transform: perspective(0px);
```

### Animation Timing
- **Quick interactions:** `0.3s` (hover, click feedback)
- **Moderate interactions:** `0.4s` (fade effects)
- **Slow interactions:** `1s` (expansion, complex animations)

