## Color System

### Color Categories

#### Text Colors
```scss
// Primary text
color: #181a20;
color: #212121;

// Secondary text
color: #717171;
color: #616161;
color: #757575;

// Disabled/muted text
color: #bdbdbd;
color: rgba(143, 143, 143, 0.54);

// Light text
color: #d3d3d3;

// White text
color: #ffffff;
color: #fff;
```

#### Background Colors
```scss
// White backgrounds
background: #fff;
background: #ffffff;

// Light gray backgrounds
background: #f6f6f6;
background: #f4f6f8;
background: #fafafa;

// Dark backgrounds
background: #181a20;
background: #000000;
background: black;
```

#### Border Colors
```scss
// Light borders
border: 1px solid #eee;
border: 1px solid #ddd;
border: 1px solid #c4c4c4;
border: 1px solid rgba(196, 196, 196, 0.71);
border: 1px solid rgba(196, 196, 196, 0.79);
```

#### Accent Colors (Customizable)
```scss
// Primary accent (red)
background: #eb6753;
background: #E92C28;
color: #f64747;
color: #f54d56;

// Secondary accent (blue)
background: #1646C1;

// Purple accent
color: #9c67f6;
```

### Color Usage Guidelines

1. **Text Hierarchy:**
   - Primary: `#181a20`, `#212121`
   - Secondary: `#717171`, `#616161`
   - Disabled: `#bdbdbd`, `rgba(143, 143, 143, 0.54)`

2. **Backgrounds:**
   - Pages: `#f6f6f6` (light gray)
   - Cards/Components: `#fff` (white)
   - Dark sections: `#181a20`

3. **Borders:**
   - Primary: `#ddd`
   - Light: `#eee`
   - Darker: `#c4c4c4`

4. **Interactive Elements:**
   - Default: `#181a20`
   - Active/Focus: Accent color
   - Disabled: `#bdbdbd`

