## Layout System

### Container System

```scss
// PC Wrapper
#pc-wrap {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

// Standard container
.container {
  position: relative;
  width: 1300px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
}

// Smaller containers
width: 1260px;  // Alternative container
width: 1174px;  // Specific layouts
```

### Common Layout Widths

```scss
// Sidebar/Filter panels
width: 266px;
width: 339px;

// Main content areas
width: 936px;
width: 590px;
width: 642px;

// Card widths
width: 300px;   // Small card
width: 296px;   // List card
width: 400px;   // Medium card
width: 410px;   // Large card
width: 233px;   // Agent card
width: 205px;   // Small agent card
```

### Layout Patterns

#### Flex Layouts
```scss
// Column layout
display: flex;
flex-direction: column;

// Row layout
display: flex;
flex-direction: row;

// Wrapped layout
display: flex;
flex-direction: row;
flex-wrap: wrap;

// Centered content
display: flex;
justify-content: center;
align-items: center;

// Space between
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
```

#### Positioning
```scss
// Relative positioning
position: relative;

// Absolute positioning (badges, overlays)
position: absolute;
top: 20px;
left: 20px;

// Common absolute positions
top: 12px; left: 12px;     // Small offset
top: 20px; left: 20px;     // Standard offset
bottom: 20px; left: 20px;  // Bottom left
```

