## Component Patterns

### Card Components

#### Basic Card Structure
```scss
.card {
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: #fff;
  box-shadow: 0px 1px 4px 0px rgba(24, 26, 32, 0.07);
  
  .card-img {
    border-radius: 12px 12px 0px 0px;
    background-size: cover;
  }
  
  .info {
    padding: 20px 22px 17px;
    border-radius: 0px 0px 12px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-top: none;
  }
}
```

#### Card Sizes
```scss
// Small card
width: 300px;
height: 375px;

// Medium card
width: 410px;
height: 455px;

// List card
width: 296px;
height: 413px;
```

### Badge Components

```scss
.badge {
  padding: 6px 34px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: #eb6753;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

// Small badge
padding: 8px 12px;
font-size: 12px;

// Medium badge
padding: 12px;
font-size: 12px;
```

### Button Patterns

```scss
// Default button
button {
  text-transform: none;
  box-shadow: none;
  padding: 0;
  color: #181a20;
  min-width: auto;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

// Outline button
button.outline {
  border: 1px solid #eee;
}

// Contained button
button.contain {
  color: #fff;
}

// Active state
&.active {
  border: 1px solid #181a20;
  background: #fff;
  color: #181a20;
}

// Button sizes
width: 216.612px;
height: 36px;

// Icon buttons
width: 16px;
height: 16px;

// Larger buttons
width: 40px;
height: 40px;

// Round buttons
width: 53px;
height: 53px;
border-radius: 50%;
```

### Avatar/Image Patterns

```scss
// Profile images
img {
  border-radius: 50%;
  width: 79px;
  height: 79px;
  object-fit: cover;
}

// Large agent images
width: 209px;
height: 209px;
border-radius: 50%;

// Medium avatars
width: 80px;
height: 80px;
border-radius: 50%;
```

### Divider Patterns

```scss
.divider {
  width: 100%;
  height: 1px;
  background: #ddd;
}

// Vertical divider
height: 48px;
border-left: 1px solid #ddd;

// HR elements
hr {
  border-width: 0;
  border-bottom-width: thin;
  border-color: #eee;
  margin: auto;
}
```

