## Form Elements

### Input Fields

```scss
.input {
  height: 48px;        // Standard MUI input
  height: 49px;        // Custom input
  height: 53px;        // Large input
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
  background: #fff;
  outline: none;
  padding-left: 15px;
  
  // Text styles
  color: #717171;
  font-family: $font;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 26px;
}

// Placeholder
input::placeholder {
  color: #717171;
  font-family: $font;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 26px;
}
```

### Select/Dropdown

```scss
.select {
  width: 100%;
  height: 49px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
  background: #fff;
  outline: none;
  padding-left: 15px;
  appearance: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  text-align: left;
}
```

### Checkbox

```scss
.checkbox {
  width: 16px;
  height: 15px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  
  &.Mui-checked {
    color: black;
  }
}
```

### Form Helper Text

```scss
.helper-text {
  margin: 5px 0 0 2px;
  line-height: 1.2;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 400;
}
```

### Form Labels

```scss
.input-label {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 13px;
}
```

