## Responsive Design

### Breakpoints

The project primarily uses a desktop-first approach with a fixed container width:

```scss
// PC Container
width: 1300px;

// MUI Breakpoint override
@media (min-width: 600px) {
  padding-left: 0;
  padding-right: 0;
}
```

### Mobile Considerations

- Mobile styles are kept in separate files (`mobile/general.scss`)
- Use `#pc-wrap` for desktop styles
- Maintain responsive images with `object-fit: cover` or `contain`
- Consider touch targets (minimum 40px x 40px)

---

## General Rules

### Reset & Base Styles

```scss
// All elements reset
margin: 0;
padding: 0;
border: 0;
font-size: 100%;
vertical-align: baseline;
font-family: $font;

// Body
body {
  line-height: 1;
  font-family: $font;
  background: #fff;
  height: 100%;
  min-height: 100%;
}

// Paragraphs and spans
span, p {
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin: 0;
}

// Links
a {
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #212121;
}

// Images
img {
  vertical-align: bottom;
}

// Lists
ol, ul {
  list-style: none;
}
```

### Scrollbar Styling

```scss
body::-webkit-scrollbar {
  width: 9px;
}

body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
  height: 30%;
  background: #bdbdbd;
  border-radius: 10px;
}

body::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
  background: #eee;
}
```

### Text Overflow

```scss
// Single line truncation
overflow: hidden;
text-overflow: ellipsis;
white-space: nowrap;
```

### Box Sizing

```scss
box-sizing: border-box;
```

### Cursor Styles

```scss
cursor: pointer;    // Interactive elements
cursor: default;    // Default state
```

### Z-Index Layers

```scss
z-index: 1;    // Base layer
z-index: 2;    // Elevated elements
// Use sparingly and document when using higher values
```

---

## Material UI Component Overrides

### Global Overrides

```typescript
// Typography
MuiTypography: {
  styleOverrides: {
    root: {
      letterSpacing: '0',
    },
  },
}

// Container
MuiContainer: {
  styleOverrides: {
    root: {
      maxWidth: 'inherit',
      padding: '0',
    },
  },
}

// Box
MuiBox: {
  styleOverrides: {
    root: {
      padding: '0',
    },
  },
}

// Button
MuiButton: {
  styleOverrides: {
    root: {
      color: '#212121',
      minWidth: 'auto',
      lineHeight: '1.2',
      boxShadow: 'none',
    },
  },
}

// List components
MuiList, MuiListItem, MuiListItemButton: {
  styleOverrides: {
    root: {
      padding: '0',
    },
  },
}
```

